{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Whatta Frogs?",
    "steam_appid": 3762800,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762800/extras/3c9f424549a3f1186b39f570f033b8f2.avif?t=1754406722\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAIN GOAL: Complete the objective assigned to your role and score points to win!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All players start in a shared lobby, where each chooses a box. The player who picks the winning box becomes the first jury member of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player can customize their character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game begins: the jury has 30 seconds of one-on-one conversation with each player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is one neutral box between the jury and contestants that doesn\u2019t belong to anyone\u2014any contestant may ask to peek inside or swap it with their own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all the one-on-one talks, everyone gets 30 seconds of open group discussion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jury has 15 seconds to make their final decision.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762800/extras/8cd3d04aba23dcd14629d4e4750c2b96.avif?t=1754406722\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 5 players standing side by side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player has a box and can check its contents at any time\u2014just be careful not to let others peek!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may request to view the neutral box or swap it with yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak one-on-one with the jury and try to persuade him.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points if you complete your role. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762800/extras/9d9d7753b4eb173fb4d5c4bfe2dffed8.avif?t=1754406722\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to and analyze all contestants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to figure out which box contains the fruit or not, depending on your objective for this round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide whether or not to let contestants inspect the neutral box.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Force someone to swap their box with the neutral one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the box that contains the fruit to earn points.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762800/extras/0df2463810b9cda20afb76fb65d8fa7a.avif?t=1754406722\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch out!</strong> Special modifiers can change the game\u2014like score multipliers, peeking inside certain boxes, reducing another player\u2019s voice chat time and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End the round with a fruit in your box and choose 1 out of 3 random cards. Use them before the jury makes their final decision!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762800/extras/932efa3d26e6a486d5e1066bcd2a2a6e.avif?t=1754406722\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adorable little froggy is already cute\u2014<strong><i>but why not make them even more unique?</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762800/extras/3c9f424549a3f1186b39f570f033b8f2.avif?t=1754406722\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MAIN GOAL: Complete the objective assigned to your role and score points to win!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All players start in a shared lobby, where each chooses a box. The player who picks the winning box becomes the first jury member of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player can customize their character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game begins: the jury has 30 seconds of one-on-one conversation with each player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is one neutral box between the jury and contestants that doesn\u2019t belong to anyone\u2014any contestant may ask to peek inside or swap it with their own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all the one-on-one talks, everyone gets 30 seconds of open group discussion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jury has 15 seconds to make their final decision.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762800/extras/8cd3d04aba23dcd14629d4e4750c2b96.avif?t=1754406722\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 5 players standing side by side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player has a box and can check its contents at any time\u2014just be careful not to let others peek!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may request to view the neutral box or swap it with yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak one-on-one with the jury and try to persuade him.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points if you complete your role. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762800/extras/9d9d7753b4eb173fb4d5c4bfe2dffed8.avif?t=1754406722\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to and analyze all contestants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to figure out which box contains the fruit or not, depending on your objective for this round.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide whether or not to let contestants inspect the neutral box.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Force someone to swap their box with the neutral one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the box that contains the fruit to earn points.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762800/extras/0df2463810b9cda20afb76fb65d8fa7a.avif?t=1754406722\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch out!</strong> Special modifiers can change the game\u2014like score multipliers, peeking inside certain boxes, reducing another player\u2019s voice chat time and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End the round with a fruit in your box and choose 1 out of 3 random cards. Use them before the jury makes their final decision!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762800/extras/932efa3d26e6a486d5e1066bcd2a2a6e.avif?t=1754406722\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your adorable little froggy is already cute\u2014<strong><i>but why not make them even more unique?</i></strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Persuade your friends by lying or telling the truth in this social deduction game, all in the pursuit of scoring as many points as possible! Does your box have a fruit? Yes or no, it doesn\u2019t matter\u2014just convince them to pick you!",
